Replace localhost URLs in terminal with server URL

This patch provides complete localhost URL replacement in the terminal:
1. Display: Replaces localhost URLs in terminal output before displaying
2. Navigation: Replaces localhost URLs when clicking links

Server URL Detection:
- First checks for ?serverUrl=<url> query parameter
- Falls back to window.location.origin if no query parameter

Example Usage:
URL: http://0.0.0.0:8080/?serverUrl=https://custom.com
Terminal shows: Local: http://localhost:3000/
- Displayed as: Local: https://custom.com/
- Clicking opens: https://custom.com/

Supports: localhost, 127.0.0.1, 0.0.0.0 with any port

